    "highlights": "Thick underlines for links (`text-decoration-thickness: 2px`) offset from the text (`text-underline-offset: .3125em`) with a brand green hover/active state (`#76b900`). External links automatically append a Font Awesome icon via pseudo-elements.",
    "insights": [
      "The design system is built entirely on custom localized brand fonts (e.g., NVIDIA-NALA for US/Americas, NVIDIA-EMEA, NVIDIA-APAC) to maintain a seamless global brand identity while supporting broad language requirements.",
      "Line-heights rely extensively on relative units (`em` or `%`), such as `1.25em` for headings and `1.666em` for standard paragraphs, ensuring optimal vertical rhythm and scalability.",
      "Links and interactive elements are highly accessible, utilizing offset green underlines that grow in contrast upon interaction, supplemented by external link icons mapped to pseudo-elements."
    ]
